WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.109 --> 00:00:02.840
- If you like pizza, and you enjoy pizza,

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:06.107
and you eat pizza, the
likelihood is extremely high

00:00:06.107 --> 00:00:09.024
that you have seen our pizza boxes.

00:00:11.946 --> 00:00:16.113
My name is Gil Korine, and I
make pizza boxes for a living.

00:00:17.086 --> 00:00:19.745
We roughly make 10 million boxes a week.

00:00:19.745 --> 00:00:21.488
As far as the design is concerned,

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:23.039
it's very particular.

00:00:23.039 --> 00:00:24.548
You know, picture of a pizza box,

00:00:24.548 --> 00:00:26.810
kind of like an album used to be.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:30.178
It kind of creates what
the artist is all about,

00:00:30.178 --> 00:00:34.345
and that's what, you know, these owners
view their pizza boxes as.

00:00:35.317 --> 00:00:38.622
- I've probably done
over 10 thousand designs.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:42.072
This is a Holly original,
and it's everywhere.

00:00:42.072 --> 00:00:43.835
I see it in the garbage pails,

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:46.034
I see it on the side of the parkway,

00:00:46.034 --> 00:00:49.245
I see it at friend’s houses
when they get pizza.

00:00:49.245 --> 00:00:51.816
The fact that so many people,
literally millions of people

00:00:51.816 --> 00:00:54.484
have seen my work and
don't know that it's me,

00:00:54.484 --> 00:00:57.507
kinda makes me chuckle
to myself (chuckles)

00:00:57.507 --> 00:00:59.867
like I'm somehow sneaking through life

00:00:59.867 --> 00:01:02.950
with this identity that no one knows.

00:01:05.951 --> 00:01:08.237
- Having started the
business from the beginning,

00:01:08.237 --> 00:01:11.495
the one thing about pizza, it
brings happiness to everybody.

00:01:11.495 --> 00:01:13.403
Everyone loves pizza.

00:01:13.403 --> 00:01:15.986
(upbeat music)

